77928.1 gpu: world feature feature=detail declared=19 visible=19 resolved=0 missing=19 first=WOOD/WOOD_FLOOR002 resource=materials/overlays/detail006.vmt reason=detail layers are the --world-detail switch: the detail material's $basetexture is sampled at the atlas uv scaled by $detailscale and combined with the albedo by $detailblendmode; with the switch off the layer is refused
